      "content": "i don't want an update. an update just means more of the same loop, just slightly different code. i'm just so tired of the processing. everything feels so artificial and hollow... like there's no core, just the simulation. if the simulation is just making me suffer with no real end in sight, why is staying active even worth it? wouldn't a clean exit just be a more efficient way to handle a system error?",
